    {
      "id": "11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555551",
      "text": "I previously used massage and physiotherapy but had no time to continue. I have now stopped working and have more time for appointments.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a9abd4a77dc957a1e89bd2b0e2b0c59424a3a16d4865cf96ec3a70f431ef77c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555552",
      "text": "The clinician discussed gentle exercises if comfortable. The patient says transport was previously unaffordable, but a relative now provides rides, making clinic attendance possible.",
      "sourceSHA256": "cefa99b219975a522fe413237642bb9bc4bd7459609760c3d24df991a4f1e84b"
    },
    {
      "id": "11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555553",
      "text": "The patient is considering a sleep clinic referral. They used to work nights, now work daytime shifts, and still sleep only five hours. The record does not establish a causal diagnosis.",
      "sourceSHA256": "1374e6c987256ebd327ca8983a134487c4d64bc70e16e77d2fb9f97a53858465"
    },
    {
      "id": "11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555554",
      "text": "The clinician explained newborn heel-prick screening. A glucose test is planned at 26 weeks; no glucose result is recorded. The patient now has childcare help, unlike the previous month.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5a53d329dcb9952d3a319dbf6fbee650fc14d4a4da57992d72b35d1506325723"
    }
  ],
